<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets First Pacific warrants.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets First Pacific warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Tuesday it has launched 160 million American-style call warrants on shares of First Pacific Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$8.44	PREMIUM	  9.67 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.313     GEARING	  3.37X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	11.NOV.97    MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG    PAYDATE	  3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	HK$10.55     GOVERNING LAW  HONG KONG</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	PHYSICAL SHARES OR IN CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
